      "message": "I think this bot could be helpful in showing developers what changes need to happen as an FYI, but I don\u0027t think the bot will succeed very often. Using https://crrev.com/1348507 as the most recent examle, the Clang DEPS roll needs to also update Abseil and //tools/rust.\n\nIn practice, this means PDFium has to do the following all at once:\n1) Update GCS DEPS entries.\n2) Roll //tools/clang\n3) Roll //tools/rust\n4) Roll //third_party/abseil",
