      "side": 1,
      "message": "My understanding was that in chromium/src //tools/clang and //tools/rust are rolled (producing that example CL) producing new GCS deps versions for src/third_party/llvm-build/Release+Asserts and src/third_party/rust-toolchain. Then, pdfium would want to update the pdfium DEPS file to match the new versions in the src DEPS. I\u0027m thinking that this builder would run once a day and it would catch when the src DEPS are changed and sync as appropriate. Am I missing something?\n\nAs for third_party/abseil, I\u0027m not familiar with how it relates to the clang and rust rolls.",
